/-!
# The Falconer distance conjecture in all dimensions

The all-dimensional theorem follows from planar Furstenberg incidence,
higher-dimensional angular estimates, graph bounds and reconstruction of
the original distance measure. The conditional implication from the planar
Furstenberg estimate is also formalized.
-/
